{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not mark an aborted export as delivered to every exporter**\n\nWhen exporter N raises `BaseException`, `_export()` exits before invoking later exporters, but this `finally` still advances the lane and lets `drain()` succeed. Those exporters silently lose the record. Contain the failure per exporter and continue, or track per-exporter progress and advance the lane only after every exporter was attempted.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7wUrDb","finding_digest":"d006b35fdae65f6be339b938ee0c34a1f512743c8a3d6aac9e8b5391c1e9cd25","finding_id":"arf_v1_2adlgx624zpwxyzzxe4o4dbuuh","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_run_loop::aborted-export-advanced-as-delivered","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_run_loop::aborted-export-advanced-as-delivered","line":318,"observation_digest":"890d073ec60f0c057a838a8307252dfac3d019f69429066a398dd1f2f98c1f68","observation_id":"aro_v1_regqopwgb4gak6udrkbqojjn7l","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-17T00:20:37Z","review_id":"arr_v1_33ayiya5fwsl4v4tcidzfuh3ei","reviewed_base_sha":"cf4d27f59c2bf14f87c3ef75f58fc0881b2e2c34","reviewed_head_sha":"fb8af739a92f7fd8070d928029150fe4e5c9cc61","reviewer":"codex","start_line":313,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":734},"record_id":"art_v1_54dmq4dfnxwx3wc57sj6dwggba","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T00:20:37Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
